# Gate step 1471-8ydv — data, not code (order 1072-b7eq).
#
# WHAT IT GUARDS. A WSL2 gate's memory floor judges the WINDOWS host again.
# with-wsl2-builder.sh samples the host's MemFree on the Windows side (Git
