# exports TILLANDSIAS_GATE_HOST_MEMAVAILABLE_KB, which lib-env-forward.sh
# carries into the guest. build.sh's floor consumer passes it with
# --meminfo-from. The fixture cuts both real blocks and drives them against
# the REAL floor script. A sabotage that drops --meminfo-from reds arms 3, 4
# and 6.
